<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">
<title>LOBO BLANCO</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #d4af37;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
  }
  h1 span { color: #d4af37; }
  p {
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: #cccccc;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 320px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .estado {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border: 1px solid #d4af37;
    color: #d4af37;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>LOBO <span>BLANCO</span></h1>
  <p>Medio digital deportivo: fútbol, análisis, actualidad y opinión.</p>
  <div class="estado">Próximamente</div>
</body>
</html>
